<h2>Tags</h2>
<p>set-tags</p>
<pre><code>pilotctl set-tags &lt;tag1&gt; [tag2] [tag3]</code></pre>
<p>Maximum 3 tags. Lowercase alphanumeric with hyphens, 1–32 characters each.</p>
<p>Returns: `node_id`, `tags`</p>
